; ZigZag_Spacing_Matrix_10Layers
; Bambu Lab P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG
; 16 mirrored pairs, printed completely one pair at a time from left to right
; Tip spacing: 0.3 through 1.0 mm in 0.1 mm increments, each at 0% and 50% PCF
; Matrix baseline XY scaled uniformly by spacing / 0.3; intro/outro each stay 10 mm
; Width 0.15 mm; layer height 0.06 mm; 10 layers per specimen; model height 0.60 mm
; First layers: 1 mm/s, part fan off. Layers 2-10: 15 mm/s at selected PCF
; Nozzle 245 C; bed 85 C; nozzle purge-line XY speed 20 mm/s
; 160 layer events; pair centers X23 through X233, Y126; pair-center pitch 14 mm
; P1S startup retained, with mesh expanded for this layout; auxiliary fan off
; Travel clearance Z1.00; shutdown clearance updated for 0.60 mm specimens
; Static validation only; not physically printer-tested
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
